-- sga-tests-choice-of-fund.l4: worked cases for sga-choice-of-fund.l4. Expected values are hand-written from sections 32C to 32ZA.

§ `Section 32C: the limbs`

-- Arguments: chosen fund; unfunded public sector scheme; Commonwealth employee who is a member of the CSS or the PSS.
#ASSERT `limb 32C(1) is met` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `limb 32C(1) is met` FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`limb 32C(1) is met` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`limb 32C(1) is met` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
