#ASSERT NOT (`limbs 32C(6B) to (9) are met` FALSE FALSE)
-- 32CA overrides 32C: a direct cost or charge on the employee.
#ASSERT `the contribution is made in compliance with the choice of fund requirements` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
